# Build context for json_schema_rs_differential/Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Allowlist: only what Cargo needs to load the workspace and build the harness. Every workspace
# member must be present for Cargo to load the workspace, even though only the differential
# crate is built.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!json_schema_rs/
!json_schema_rs_macro/
!json_schema_rs_benchmark/
!json_schema_rs_differential/

# Large or generated content inside the allowed members
**/target/
json_schema_rs_benchmark/fixtures/
json_schema_rs_benchmark/results.*
json_schema_rs_differential/reports/
json_schema_rs_differential/results.*
json_schema_rs_differential/Dockerfile*
